e (can be stored at regular refrigerator temperature (2-5 °C).",,,"Limited evidence available on long-term vaccine effectiveness of new/ | Long-term | improve long-term competition and overall market health. | • Countries need to invest in resources to manage and implement operational activities of the stockpile and storage requirements for the | different vaccine products, particularly for mRNA products which need to be stored at -80C. | (Next generation, storage | 1 Moderna mRNA-1283 – Next generation vaccine (can be stored at regular refrigerator temperature (2-5 °C). | long-term vaccine effectiveness against SARS-CoV-2 variants: a model- | Hogan AB, et al. Long Term Vaccination Strategies to Mitigate the Global Impact of SARS-CoV-2 Transmission: A Modelling Study. [Preprint]. In press 2022. | taken place & more are expected. Long term sustainability remains a challenge | incentivizing new suppliers to enter the market and improve long-term competition, and | Hogan AB, Wu SL, Toor J, Doohan P, Watson OJ, Winskill P, et al. Long Term Vaccination Strategies to Mitigate","Limited evidence available on long-term vaccine effectiveness of new/ | Long-term | improve long-term competition and overall market health. | • Countries need to invest in resources to manage and implement operational activities of the stockpile and storage requirements for the | different vaccine products, particularly for mRNA products which need to be stored at -80C. | (Next generation, storage | 1 Moderna mRNA-1283 – Next generation vaccine (can be stored at regular refrigerator temperature (2-5 °C). | long-term vaccine effectiveness against SARS-CoV-2 variants: a model- | Hogan AB, et al. Long Term Vaccination Strategies to Mitigate the Global Impact of SARS-CoV-2 Transmission: A Modelling Study. [Preprint]. In press 2022. | taken place & more are expected. Long term sustainability remains a challenge | incentivizing new suppliers to enter the market and improve long-term competition, and | H