rage: Store in a dry and well-ventilated place in -70 °C.","Storage and Stability | Store product at –70oC. For optimal storage, aliquot | store at recommended temperature. For most favorable | Store product at –70oC. For optimal storage, | Article 7 - Handling and Storage | Conditions for safe storage: Store in a dry and well-ventilated place in -70 °C. Keep container upright and tightly closed. | Conditions for safe storage: Store in a dry and well-ventilated place in -70 °C.","1, 4",storage,Page 1 [shipping]: Storage & Shipping | Page 4 [shipping]: Reactivity: Stable under recommended transport and storage conditions. | Page 4 [shipping]: Chemical stability: Stable under recommended transport and storage conditions. | Page 4 [unclassified]: Vapor pressure at 20 °C: 0.1 hPa (temperature: 20 °C) | Page 4 [experimental]: Boiling point/Boiling range: 100 °C. (temperature: 100 °C) | Page 4 [unclassified]: Flash point: > 100 °C. (temperature: 100 °C) | Page 4 [unclassified]: Ignition temperature: 400 °C. (temperature: 400 °C),PDF,https://cdn1.sinobiological.com/datasheet/signaling/A09-11G/K1720-1.pdf
