ution. After reconstitution, it is recommended that the protein be aliquoted for optimal storage. Avoid repeated freeze-thaw cycles.","In general, recombinant proteins are provided as lyophilized powder which are shipped at ambient temperature.
Bulk packages of recombinant proteins are provided as frozen liquid. They are shipped out with blue ice unless customers require otherwise.
