ies for optimal storage. Avoid,when stored at 37 ℃ (or ambient temperature). | Storage: | Recommend to aliquot the protein into smaller quantities for optimal storage. Avoid,1,storage,Page 1 [shipping]: Shipped at ambient temperature. The liquid or lyophilized enzyme is stable for at least 21d,PDF,https://cdn1.sinobiological.com/reagent/SSNP01.pdf
