Product information for vaccines and cold chain equipment,Fiber protein,P48165,Gavi,"The CCE Technology Guide provides countries with guidance on selecting cold chain equipment that will meet the needs of the country’s immunisation programme. The CCE Technology Guide currently includes the following categories of equipment: Ice-lined refrigerators and freezers, solar direct drive refrigerators and freezers, freeze-free vaccine carriers, freeze-free cold boxes, long-term passive devices, temperature monitoring devices, and voltage stabilizers. Information is also included on equipment pricing, estimated operating costs, and product specifications.",,"The source reports a buffer/formulation, but its ingredients are not recognized by this simple interpretation rule set. Use the exact composition, pH, concentrations, and manufacturer's technical notes to interpret it. These are general formulation-level interpretations, not proof of the product's stability, biological activity, or suitability for a particular assay.","The CCE Technology Guide provides countries with guidance on selecting cold chain equipment that will meet the needs of the country’s immunisation programme. The CCE Technology Guide currently includes the following categories of equipment: Ice-lined refrigerators and freezers, solar direct drive refrigerators and freezers, freeze-free vaccine carriers, freeze-free cold boxes, long-term passive devices, temperature monitoring devices, and voltage stabilizers. Information is also included on equipment pricing, estimated operating costs, and product specifications.",,Not specified,No explicit refrigerated/frozen requirement or interpretable storage temperature was found in the extracted storage evidence.,,,,,,,,storage_information_not_found,,webpage,https://www.gavi.org/our-work/market-shaping/product-information-vaccines-cold-chain-equipment
