The speed of this response is made possible by CEPIâs prior investments in rapid-response vaccine platforms, R&D networks and partnerships with world-leading researchers. CEPI 3.0âs core priorities â a viral family approach to vaccine development, readiness across multiple technology platforms, and networks and capabilities that can be rapidly activated â are critical to the Bundibugyo response today and to CEPIâs mission to prepare for the viral threats of tomorrow.",,storage,,webpage,https://cepi.net/ethiopia-norway-and-uk-commit-us240-million-cepis-global-plan-tackle-epidemic-and-pandemic-threats
