"Protein subunit vaccines â What they are, and what they are notâ¯",Protein X (Mu),,CEPI,,,,,,Not specified,No explicit refrigerated/frozen requirement or interpretable storage temperature was found in the extracted storage evidence.,"Stability and a low risk of side effects are two of the main advantages of protein subunit vaccines. Because they contain no live components, they are also particularly suitable for pregnant women and people with compromised or weakened immune systems, such as elderly people or people living with HIV.",,,,"Stability and a low risk of side effects are two of the main advantages of protein subunit vaccines. Because they contain no live components, they are also particularly suitable for pregnant women and people with compromised or weakened immune systems, such as elderly people or people living with HIV.
