Independent Assessment Committee,glucose oxidase,K9L4P7,Gavi,"The Independent Assessment Committee (IAC) was created as an impartial oversight body of the AMC. The IAC is responsible for determining whether a candidate vaccine meets the minimally acceptable profile (the “Target Product Profile”) in terms of vaccine serotypes, target population/target age group, dosage schedule, route of administration and product formulation. The Target Product Profile is designed to ensure that AMC vaccines meet developing country needs.",,"The source reports a buffer/formulation, but its ingredients are not recognized by this simple interpretation rule set. Use the exact composition, pH, concentrations, and manufacturer's technical notes to interpret it. These are general formulation-level interpretations, not proof of the product's stability, biological activity, or suitability for a particular assay.","The Independent Assessment Committee (IAC) was created as an impartial oversight body of the AMC. The IAC is responsible for determining whether a candidate vaccine meets the minimally acceptable profile (the “Target Product Profile”) in terms of vaccine serotypes, target population/target age group, dosage schedule, route of administration and product formulation. The Target Product Profile is designed to ensure that AMC vaccines meet developing country needs.",,Not specified,No explicit refrigerated/frozen requirement or interpretable storage temperature was found in the extracted storage evidence.,,,,,,,,storage_information_not_found,,webpage,https://www.gavi.org/investing-gavi/innovative-financing/pneumococcal-advance-market-commitment-amc/independent
