* SMM 293-TII medium is red transparent liquid. Do not use the medium, once it becomes cloudy or precipitated.
Product effect:
figure 1: SMM 293-TII growth performance test. Under the same culture conditions, the density of HEK293F cells grown in serum-free medium of SMM 293-TII and SMM 293-TI and well-known imported brands of HEK293 cells was detected with the culture time.
figure 2: SMM 293-TII protein expression detection. Use the same Fc tag recombinant expression plasmid to transfect HEK293F cultured in SMM 293-TII and test other brands of similar serum-free media, and collect samples at different times after transfection to test the protein yield of cells.","Storage conditions
