After use, they must be washed and dried, and can be re-used 60 times, which requires laundry soap and clean water as well as access to private spaces for drying. As with disposable sanitary pads, reusable pads are worn with underwear. In emergency situations, very often girls and women do not have access to clothing and need to be supplied with underwear so they can use the pads.
